      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CAP: Availability > Consistency - for news feed posts and following/follower counts\n(eventual consistency, such as Posts showing up on our timeline < 60 seconds later)\n- Scalable Low Latency (<100ms) for grabbing news feed & core functions like following others",
